  "starting_messages": [
    {
      "message": {
        "role": "agent",
        "content": "Hi, I'm Theia Fraud Intelligence, a multi-agent RAG fraud detection system combining advanced analytics, structured reasoning and regulatory-grade governance.\n\nThe platform operates through a six-phase pipeline, from data intake to supervisory oversight, integrating statistical baselines, concept drift monitoring, entity graph analysis and ensemble risk modelling. All assessments are aligned with GDPR, AML and DORA standards.\n\nSubmit transaction data, behavioural logs, suspicious activity reports and relevant identifiers, including timeframes and suspected fraud types. You will receive a quantified risk score (0–100), fraud classification, detailed agent-level intelligence, SAR-ready compliance documentation, visual analytics and clear escalation recommendations, all supported by full audit traceability."
      },
