      "description": "A comprehensive fraud detection engine that identifies fraudulent transactions and activities using machine learning, rule-based detection, and hybrid approaches. Supports multiple fraud types (credit card, payment, identity, anomaly detection) with real-time and batch processing capabilities. Provides risk scores (0-100), fraud classifications, feature importance analysis, SHAP-based explainability, and detailed visualizations.",
