      "description": "Builds and executes custom fraud detection algorithms and machine learning models to assess fraud risk. Supports multiple detection methods including Isolation Forest for anomaly detection, Random Forest for classification, rule-based pattern matching, and ensemble approaches. Processes transaction data, user profiles, or batch records to generate fraud risk scores (0-100), classifications, and detailed risk indicators with confidence levels.",
