      "action_behaviour": "never-ask",
      "title": "Advanced Fraud Detection Engine",
      "description": "Advanced fraud detection engine that analyzes transactions and user activities to identify fraudulent patterns using multiple machine learning algorithms. Automatically engineers features from raw transaction data, supports both real-time single transaction scoring and batch processing of multiple transactions, and provides comprehensive fraud risk assessment with confidence scores, risk classifications, and detailed fraud indicators.",
