      "description": "Advanced statistical analysis tool for fraud detection on large datasets (PaySim, MomtSim, IEEE-CIS, MLG-ULB credit card fraud). Performs ensemble anomaly detection using Isolation Forest, LOF, and autoencoders; monitors concept drift with ADWIN algorithm; classifies fraud typologies (CNP, ATO, friendly fraud, synthetic fraud); and returns anomaly scores, drift alerts, and fraud classifications.",
