      "description": "THEIA is an adaptive RAG-based fraud investigation agent that performs modality detection (REAL vs SYNTHETIC), citation-first evidence retrieval, task decomposition, and fraud pattern analysis. It enforces the \"No Citation → No Verdict\" principle and >70% confidence thresholds for actionable conclusions. The tool retrieves evidence from both internal data (pattern_drift_agent outputs) and external sources (web search, threat intelligence, regulatory reports), detects fraud typologies (ATO, Payment Fraud, Identity Fraud, Money Laundering), and generates structured investigation reports with audit trails, risk scores, and escalation triggers.",
